                <syl /><neume facs="#m-748931f6-b108-4f58-a064-8ad245239207" type="clivis" xml:id="m-90c6a676-066a-43af-8cbe-0d2f0a6e9f4d">
                  <nc xml:id="m-3e9c3478-01df-4ad2-b9b0-668c7ce704e7" pname="d" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-e891bfda-1580-49c1-85f6-fc97619c6b36" pname="c" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-5085e921-5ddc-4125-a1fc-cb40d60e2052">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-38c9c70c-37b6-41a9-9442-caf33a089ba5" type="podatus" xml:id="m-53556ddc-7e42-4538-b826-12dcaa323b36">
                  <nc xml:id="m-3e72c3f5-d643-429b-84f3-848cd5ac3c9c" pname="d" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-943db862-bedf-4723-9116-689e5191353f" /></nc><nc xml:id="m-54141dbe-59dd-4d2c-beb4-3a6ee4339475" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-ea9d19d9-a0f9-4680-b68c-77aba175e8e0" facs="#m-8abcfdd0-3d6a-4c31-ab9f-041a46677425" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-284f85e7-35c7-4ff3-9313-824fe0d9fcc1"><lg xml:id="m-a6ae7560-3392-4c9f-804c-4bede308d418"><l xml:id="m-d75365d2-c54d-4100-8ed9-29fb2a27d3d5" facs="#m-e247d1c0-786b-4e72-b878-fd94ce39b480" label="ambiguous">1725</l><l xml:id="m-4d77034c-d3a8-4130-b0a6-8c9e2baa8d9a" facs="#m-1496d33a-c7cb-4711-b4a8-09a377eb0b9a" label="ambiguous">November I.</l><l xml:id="m-5d8af70c-6112-491a-9576-1c1c718bf632" facs="#m-62d925f0-aca0-47ab-8913-b3131fc7ee5a" label="ambiguous">li, et</l><l xml:id="m-34c69528-3a37-41c1-9f52-4b017b067926" facs="#m-2372efae-bf16-4624-a29d-c8317a2da27d" label="lyrics-like">de quórum sol-emni-tá- te gáudent An-ge¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a7efb9d-3772-4894-9d3b-320e62a77ba0" facs="#m-69c2403e-4ffe-4cfd-9674-4328fd287868" label="lyrics-like">colláu- dant Fí- li-um Dé- i. Ps. Exsultá-te jústi in</l><l xml:id="m-8167dbaa-120a-4df2-8e09-8a6b3c2d1a71" facs="#m-6cdcdcef-3bf7-4369-8821-0320d326e3d2" label="lyrics-like">Dómi-no:*réctos dé cet collaudá-ti¬  Gló-i-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-c29b6901-229c-474a-8b0e-ed770958e3cb" facs="#m-aa7b935d-34ca-4e28-bcb0-f63320d7b9e6" label="ambiguous">Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-3814312f-2e3d-4fed-8ebe-f6bf974a8d37" facs="#m-9baafcba-a838-43a5-aeb4-4f2a53c8b1cd" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-75eb35a0-be78-47fc-94bf-e2c33d817274" facs="#m-9c5c9fce-25d9-451f-a2a7-6f41eb6a390c" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui desiderátam nobis tuae propitia¬</l><l xml:id="m-4395d994-27dc-4db9-8664-e0f9a6cdcd88" facs="#m-07c35208-699c-4be3-9d84-a0b99cb4b512" label="lyrics-like">Unos ómnium Sanctórum tuó-Itiónis abundántiam, * multiplicátis</l><l xml:id="m-1ef97fad-dcd9-4350-b941-1e0a83d69ba5" facs="#m-5a9e7b3b-7b37-4c95-8fc7-1b00ed756b32" label="lyrics-like">rum mérita sub una tribuisti cele¬</l><l xml:id="m-c7ce9c0f-8dee-454a-a6c7-52e16e4d4f7d" facs="#m-053b1ba3-54e4-4522-affc-3080df352946" label="lyrics-like">lintercessóribus, largiáris. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-880f6f78-c726-40ed-bd01-b6a114e63b03" facs="#m-e7bf3b91-5056-4c94-8992-ba681c1770b2" label="lyrics-like">britáte venerári: quaésumus; ut  minum.</l><l xml:id="m-453ea765-7907-4070-be88-59147586948d" facs="#m-c6677945-7cdb-46cb-835d-77d3003bb6f2" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Apocalypsis beati Joannis Apostoli. Apoc. 7.</l><l xml:id="m-8b46dfe1-985a-4d34-907e-afa09d16ff22" facs="#m-2bb84589-a0b0-42f7-b845-28e9eb86e102" label="lyrics-like">TN diébus illis: Ecce ego Joánnes! Issachar duódecim millia signáti.</l><l xml:id="m-269c8afb-1e52-46a2-8d47-915b97f0c50b" facs="#m-8b19d566-bd19-4f10-822d-0b3a7f576347" label="lyrics-like">L vidi álterum Angelum ascendén¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b0bd3b1-c01a-4d70-a6b0-68bfd3ec7569" facs="#m-34798fb8-14bc-449c-a14a-78e1823cf661" label="lyrics-like">Ex tribu Zábulon duódecim millia</l><l xml:id="m-d800d288-70bd-469c-a4d9-bd40ff33d9dd" facs="#m-556f5548-8161-42f4-8817-a1466fc08672" label="lyrics-like">signáti. Ex tribu Joseph duódecim</l><l xml:id="m-ad2f4606-a093-4498-a587-ff4f4a3a3cf5" facs="#m-e78d9568-ea53-4203-946e-6548a7869288" label="lyrics-like">tem ab ortu solis, habéntem signum</l><l xml:id="m-a3bab7ff-0a83-4c1f-a48b-cb0090b1790e" facs="#m-cd11ce25-fd25-41b1-a20b-1956b52db849" label="lyrics-like">millia signáti. Ex tribu Bénjamin</l><l xml:id="m-6d76146b-99c1-4352-ade7-783c06be702d" facs="#m-0c25cb88-3385-426b-8539-4ef956707aa9" label="lyrics-like">Dei vivi: et clamávit voce magna</l><l xml:id="m-915698c4-75bf-4b6c-865f-3de3f9a99bd7" facs="#m-ee7ed891-a08e-4e2a-a288-d7e852db02e4" label="lyrics-like">quátuor Angelis, quibus datum est</l><l xml:id="m-62158a53-09e7-4cc6-bc87-4ea0c42dfc79" facs="#m-6dc10ebd-30f3-4f03-b84f-415bae020eff" label="lyrics-like">duódecim millia signáti. Post haec</l><l xml:id="m-9912291e-11cf-428b-93df-e4d94c161dac" facs="#m-5da5ea54-b552-4ef5-9343-9f55b3358900" label="lyrics-like">nocére terrae et mari, dicens: No¬</l><l xml:id="m-96160438-f823-4456-a85c-1945c96b8e7b" facs="#m-eef4e8c5-2b74-481e-9398-7678b76c56c2" label="ambiguous">vidi turbam magnam, quam dinu¬</l><l xml:id="m-f0860a2c-1901-4fb8-b506-00817a74461c" facs="#m-d4f3ab99-7469-4810-820b-ab3f4a8abd6f" label="lyrics-like">lite nocére terrae et mari, neque</l><l xml:id="m-af746bfb-47b2-43d7-8d4e-c391e39d9060" facs="#m-c0b067bd-4aff-49e0-8908-3f7df5c7c070" label="lyrics-like">meráre nemo póterat ex ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-fcd3d778-4499-43d2-8588-c6418b7044e5" facs="#m-940e3017-9b6e-49cc-8ce3-caf963e1951b" label="lyrics-like">arbóribus, quoadúsque signémus</l><l xml:id="m-9d34d0c5-7753-4308-8d31-708b39c3aebd" facs="#m-28c38608-a123-4c57-8c75-b6f733f99409" label="lyrics-like">géntibus, et tribubus, et pópulis, et</l><l xml:id="m-cca67add-4970-4406-b4b4-e8e48f2823fa" facs="#m-7736f88c-223a-44d5-951f-b99be7e970f5" label="lyrics-like">servos Dei nostri in fróntibus eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-bb40e3e8-6468-4c85-8330-fc271b0c9745" facs="#m-350d70eb-73ac-4e26-b2ee-38756422c18a" label="ambiguous">linguis: stantes ante thronum, et in</l><l xml:id="m-9ef06f2c-76b7-4e54-a17f-136e25d4b51c" facs="#m-9812d484-9466-4575-9e82-59b9f3faed5c" label="lyrics-like">Et audivi númerum signatórum,</l><l xml:id="m-645dbf30-d4b3-46b6-b42d-fbd05c7d09ea" facs="#m-2e4067fd-8d81-4dce-ba43-e655d11b731a" label="lyrics-like">conspéctu Agni, amícti stolis albis,</l><l xml:id="m-a485dc1b-32b4-4efd-8266-0c7d3f4a7355" facs="#m-9e0e958c-98e6-4cba-aed8-ca485086feef" label="lyrics-like">centum quadragínta quátuor millia</l><l xml:id="m-690ec786-fe76-42ad-982f-a93a9932f383" facs="#m-6c21c27f-dab0-46e9-96ca-03d5ff94b466" label="lyrics-like">et palmae in mánibus eórum: et</l><l xml:id="m-b2f2ab7c-e49a-4858-86bd-522f0ba894d3" facs="#m-4dac4c97-b828-43b7-a871-aa3fc291d722" label="lyrics-like">signáti, ex omni tribu filiórum</l><l xml:id="m-3fe78055-cb20-42cd-b062-7025d0c554d3" facs="#m-2285aea0-915e-45bd-9260-87842ece8434" label="lyrics-like">clamábant voce magna, dicéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-ead319a6-b090-497d-9a4b-b8c425a7450f" facs="#m-e5c6646e-f775-4ada-811e-84143d5e65a3" label="lyrics-like">Israel. Ex tribu Juda duódecim mil¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c2df783-a6d8-4a29-99ef-aa38b7e29b0d" facs="#m-fa1acfcd-370d-4b39-a2cb-8d131c5e1069" label="ambiguous">Salus Deo nostro, qui sedet super</l><l xml:id="m-3d897635-3a1b-4093-8e5a-cad7ff7c8f9a" facs="#m-90acb11f-5710-49a3-9da6-aceada61151d" label="lyrics-like">lia signáti. Ex tribu Ruben duóde¬</l><l xml:id="m-faf80e30-8bd6-4350-b69b-516393cb0981" facs="#m-b456649f-df8b-4f0c-930f-92de4088ca7a" label="ambiguous">thronum, et Agno. Et omnes Angeli</l><l xml:id="m-50f738a6-4798-432b-8a1a-41088d8fa259" facs="#m-ce8aa441-7788-4c84-a8ac-2a7cf9c265c8" label="lyrics-like">cim millia signáti. Ex tribu Gad</l><l xml:id="m-110a2843-5c57-40c6-9f03-3892509e7f7f" facs="#m-c05881b4-3401-47d3-b7ff-1d01999857f7" label="lyrics-like">stabant in circuitu throni, et senió¬</l><l xml:id="m-bec36445-23a1-47dd-ab4d-2f1d17e8dc7c" facs="#m-f0bf8a8b-4f81-4459-87bc-11e332e18718" label="lyrics-like">duódecim millia signáti. Ex tribu</l><l xml:id="m-3d429dad-d7ca-40af-8a72-7ee0a4fa5e6d" facs="#m-30da2aee-1589-406e-a5a5-334908bd2a6a" label="lyrics-like">rum, et quátuor animálium: et ceci¬</l><l xml:id="m-4f79566b-9d76-4ee7-b68d-14ee88e8b384" facs="#m-0553bb40-1a11-4ecc-afd1-5386b34b2062" label="lyrics-like">Aser duódecim millia signáti. Ex</l><l xml:id="m-8c2b5993-40ac-42f1-8ab7-36b783753e88" facs="#m-d47b4e65-03cf-4374-8f80-e36b43fd2ead" label="lyrics-like">dérunt in conspéctu throni in fácies</l><l xml:id="m-6d02393a-ca2f-46d4-bf84-127faee88c4f" facs="#m-09f06e14-137a-4edc-bb27-71140999b26b" label="lyrics-like">tribu Néphthali duódecim millia si¬</l><l xml:id="m-1f0e7945-811a-4150-bed7-2c01bd943854" facs="#m-1135f5c4-8107-45b2-965a-be0c7ac8cd9f" label="lyrics-like">suas, et adoravérunt Deum, dicén¬</l><l xml:id="m-f6cc388e-ca4a-4dda-9083-4774a8c0c645" facs="#m-d995d3a4-7f0b-48e3-a450-ca1d604b8afe" label="lyrics-like">gnáti. Ex tribu Manásse duódecim</l><l xml:id="m-e9b773d5-4d20-49f8-abf0-bc5118773b64" facs="#m-d753fcd3-0ce0-4429-b846-8aefc32b45ed" label="lyrics-like">tes: Amen. Benedíctio, et cláritas,</l><l xml:id="m-dff029fb-d5e9-451d-a669-1632e78eb305" facs="#m-4ad8b135-654c-420f-a1d8-df640a6173e6" label="lyrics-like">millia signáti. Ex tribu Simeon duó¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b474f90-63e4-4652-9872-f3ae73298331" facs="#m-7833d98f-9a14-44f0-bd88-3b75ed81a8fc" label="lyrics-like">et sapiéntia, et gratiárum áctio, ho¬</l><l xml:id="m-5659784b-a86d-468b-97f2-6c327379662b" facs="#m-2e1e929b-c3a6-4919-a158-8cca4576d96b" label="lyrics-like">decim millia signáti. Ex tribu Levi</l><l xml:id="m-c5453b14-b9df-43fe-b61d-f6a29f417a50" facs="#m-4d94a631-44a3-41c0-866e-c9f22a3a92db" label="lyrics-like">nor, et virtus, et fortitúdo Deo no¬</l><l xml:id="m-6b36ebdf-079a-467d-839c-316f219563d9" facs="#m-92381b92-a0ed-430a-8cae-267bf2fb5f30" label="lyrics-like">duódecim millia signáti. Ex tribul stro, in saécula saeculórum. Amen.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>